comments.body:
a bit of regrouping to make `false` the default return value and using the C++17 [extract](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/map/extract) here as well insteadf of storing + erasing would allow us to simplify this slightly:
```suggestion
    if (auto handle{m_by_nodeid.extract(nodeid)}) {
        if (auto iters{Find(handle.mapped())}) {
            if (confirmed_by_node) {
                // Update broadcast stats, since txid was found and its reception is confirmed by the node.
                Priority& priority = iters->by_txid->second.priority;

                ++priority.num_broadcasted;
                priority.last_broadcasted = NodeClock::now();

                auto node_handle{m_by_priority.extract(iters->by_priority)};
                node_handle.key() = priority;
                m_by_priority.insert(std::move(node_handle));
            }
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
```

