comments.body:
My understanding is that private broadcast connection count isn't modified by many threads simultaneously so we could use strong comparisons here instead.
The new value assignment could also be simplified slightly slightly:
```suggestion
    do {
        new_value = current_value - std::min(current_value, n);
    } while (!m_num_to_open.compare_exchange_strong(current_value, new_value));
```

