and use them here as
```C++
LogPrivDebug(pfrom, "Ignoring incoming message '%s'", msg_type);
```
or if we also add a similar type checker to unburden this huge method:
```C++
bool IsPrivateBroadcastInboundAllowed(std::string_view msg_type) noexcept
{
    return msg_type == NetMsgType::PONG
        || msg_type == NetMsgType::GETDATA;
}
```
we would have:
```suggestion
    if (pfrom.IsPrivateBroadcastConn() && !IsPrivateBroadcastInboundAllowed(msg_type)) {
        LogPrivDebug(pfrom, "Ignoring incoming message '%s'", msg_type);
        return;
    }
```

These helpers could of course be put to a place that's easy to review - otherwise the logic is spread around.
See [l0rinc/bitcoin@`dfebde8` (#58)](https://github.com/l0rinc/bitcoin/pull/58/commits/dfebde8318b6371437876978247568fe32223c93)

